cess\n        </button>\n    </nav>\n\n    <main class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 pt-10 pb-20 lg:pt-20\">\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center\">\n            \n            <div class=\"max-w-2xl\">\n                <div class=\"inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-white shadow-sm text-xs font-medium text-gray-600 mb-8\">\n                    Trusted by 600+ Independent Practices\n                </div>\n\n                <h1 class=\"text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-gray-900 leading-[1.1] mb-6 tracking-tight\">\n                    We help <span class=\"text-[#8B5CF6]\">independent vets</span> stand out in crowded markets\n                </h1>\n\n                <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600 mb-8 leading-relaxed max-w-lg\">\n                    Define what makes you different, attract the clients who want your approach, and stop chasing the rest.\n                </p>\n\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 mb-10\">\n                    <button class=\"px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-[#8B5CF6] text-white font-medium hover:bg-[#7c4dff] transition shadow-lg shadow-indigo-200\">\n                        Book a Demo\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-white border border-gray-200 text-gray-700 font-medium hover:bg-gray-50 transition\">\n                        Watch our process\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"space-y-3\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-gray-700\">\n                        <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-gray-900\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path></svg>\n                        <span class=\"text-sm font-medium\">Stop price competition</span>\n                    </div>\n                  